WEBVTT

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:00.856
Lakini sikufahamu japo kidogo kuwa

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:04.296
nilikuwa napata zawadi kubwa kuliko zote
nilizowahi kuziota,

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:05.520
kujithamini,

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:08.160
maarifa, nidhamu.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:12.696
Nilisisimka mno kusoma, kiasi kwamba
nilisoma kila kitu nilichokitia mkononi:

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:16.055
makaratasi ya pipi, nembo za nguo, 
alama za barabarani, kila kitu.

00:04:16.079 --> 00:04:17.326
Nilikuwa nikisoma tu vitu!

00:04:17.326 --> 00:04:18.336
(Makofi na Vifijo)

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:19.560
kusoma tu vitu.

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:24.560
Nilisisimka sana kujua jinsi ya kusoma
na kujua jinsi ya kutahajia.

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:27.006
Rafiki alikuja, akaniuliza,
"Mzee, unakula nini?"

00:04:27.006 --> 00:04:28.736
Nikasema, "P-I-P-I, pipi."

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:31.016
(Kicheko)